    "detailed_description": "Near Sol is a space strategy game developed by an indie developer.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe game takes place in the solar system and in the nearest 30 stars.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nLead a space power, small or large. Find the resources you need, or create an economic alliance with your neighbors, organize the production of the most demanded goods. Earn money. Become a rich and developed state!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDevelop powerful spaceships, build cities on distant planets, or become a large sparsely populated nation. In the cities you will find different types of citizens, resources, and opportunities for construction.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe game is published for joint development with the players!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWhat kind of resources and types of citizens would you like? (now this question is actual for the developer).<br />\r\nThe demo version is exactly the same as the paid version! Buy the game if you want to support the developer.",
